{"id":"clamconf.1","n":"clamconf","s":"1","src":{"r":{"pkg":"clamav","ver":"1.4.6-1.el9","repo":"EPEL","url":"https://dl.fedoraproject.org/pub/epel/9/Everything/x86_64/Packages/c/clamav-1.4.6-1.el9.x86_64.rpm","path":"/usr/share/man/man1/clamconf.1.gz","sha256":"d9ef528e5954a9b2a116118bccb9463866c0a4ab3c4d2681dc06908c276e1795","date":"February 12, 2007","origin":"ClamAV 1.4.6"},"u":{"pkg":"clamav-daemon","ver":"1.5.4+dfsg-0ubuntu0.22.04.1","repo":"jammy-updates/main","url":"http://archive.ubuntu.com/ubuntu/pool/main/c/clamav/clamav-daemon_1.5.4+dfsg-0ubuntu0.22.04.1_amd64.deb","path":"/usr/share/man/man1/clamconf.1.gz","sha256":"c6b2158cace34a03e908407f9aa7f7d431c506a4ef2657b654cc2d49778ff4fb","date":"February 12, 2007","origin":"ClamAV 1.5.4"}},"nopt":{"r":5,"u":5},"desc":"Clam AntiVirus configuration utility","same":true,"doc":[["NAME","<p>clamconf - Clam AntiVirus configuration utility</p>"],["SYNOPSIS","<p>clamconf [options]</p>"],["DESCRIPTION","<p>clamconf displays the values of configuration options.</p>"],["OPTIONS","<dl><dt data-o=\"\"><b>-h, --help</b></dt><dd>Display help and exit.</dd><dt data-o=\"\"><b>-V, --version</b></dt><dd>Display software version and exit.</dd><dt data-o=\"\"><b>-c DIR, --config-dir DIR</b></dt><dd>Search for configuration files clamd.conf and freshclam.conf in DIR.</dd><dt data-o=\"\"><b>-n, --non-default</b></dt><dd>Only print non-default settings.</dd><dt data-o=\"\"><b>-g CONFIG_NAME, --generate-config=CONFIG_NAME</b></dt><dd>Generate example configuration file.</dd></dl>"],["CREDITS","<p>The idea of this tool is based on Postfix's postconf. clamconf was created under pressure from Tomasz Papszun ;-)</p>"],["AUTHOR","<p>Tomasz Kojm &lt;tkojm@clamav.net&gt;</p>"],["SEE ALSO","<p>clamd.conf(5), freshclam.conf(5)</p>"]]}